# Keep the build context small and never copy secrets or local data into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
backend/tests
frontend/e2e
**/*.log
**/*.csv
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.json.gz
*.zip
